[% META
   title = "AI System Use — coordinator plan"
   description = "Audit of AI plans/docs/todos and the ordered waves that systematically improve AI use on Comserv. Sequences AIMPS, V2MIG-on-touch, AGENTS, and Hermes focus settings without stealing those plans."
   roles = "admin,developer"
   TemplateType = "Documentation"
   category = "planning,ai"
   page_version = "1.01"
   last_updated = "Wed Aug 19 2026"
   site_specific = "false"
   project_id = "280"
   project_code = "AISYSTEM"
%]
[% PageVersion = 'Documentation/AISYSTEMPlan.tt,v 1.01 2026/08/19 hermes-agent Exp - SuperGrok prepaid provider + doc sync' %]
[% IF c.session.debug_mode == 1 %][% PageVersion %][% END %]

<div class="container">
    [% INCLUDE 'admin/documentation/_doc_header.tt'
        page_title   = 'AI System Use — coordinator plan'
        site_name    = site_name
        user_role    = user_role
        last_updated = last_updated
        page_name    = page_name
        doc_project_id   = project_id
        doc_project_code = project_code %]

    <div id="toc" class="row doc-toc">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 class="doc-h2">Quick Navigation</h2>
            <p class="doc-muted">Jump to section:</p>
            <div class="doc-navrow">
                <a href="#overview" class="doc-navlink">Overview</a>
                <a href="#audit" class="doc-navlink">Audit</a>
                <a href="#order" class="doc-navlink">Wave order</a>
                <a href="#hermes" class="doc-navlink">Hermes settings</a>
                <a href="#providers" class="doc-navlink">In-app providers</a>
                <a href="#park" class="doc-navlink">Parked work</a>
                <a href="#project-tracking" class="doc-navlink">Project Tracking</a>
                <a href="#see-also" class="doc-navlink">See Also</a>
            </div>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="overview" class="doc-h2">1. Overview</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Comserv already has several AI plans. They do not agree on what to do next. This coordinator does not replace AIMPS, V2MIG, or AGENTS. It <strong>orders</strong> their remaining todos so AI use on the system improves in one sequence: focus the agents and models first, then the in-app picker, then the agent runtime, then operational agents.</p>
            <div class="doc-info">
                <p class="doc-body"><strong>Assumptions (correct in-app if wrong):</strong> parent is <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=114" class="doc-link">#114 AIC-ENH</a>. AGENTS #267 and V2MIG #259 stay top-level owners of their work. Cross-plan items are raised on the owning plan, never absorbed here.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="doc-body">Open this plan standalone: <a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AISYSTEMPlan') %]" class="doc-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/Documentation/AISYSTEMPlan</a>.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="audit" class="doc-h2">2. Audit (measured 2026-08-19)</h2>
            <h3 class="doc-h3">2.1 Plans and docs</h3>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">Doc</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Project</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Verdict</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AIModelPresentationPlan') %]" class="doc-link">AIModelPresentationPlan</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=252" class="doc-link">#252 AIMPS</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Live. P1 done. P2–P4 open. This is the in-app model-focus work.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/V2MigrationPlan') %]" class="doc-link">V2MigrationPlan</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=259" class="doc-link">#259 V2MIG</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Plan exists. Phase projects #260–264 have <strong>zero todos</strong>. Standing on-touch rules live as #2033/#2034 under AIMPS-P5.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AutonomousAgentsPlan') %]" class="doc-link">AutonomousAgentsPlan</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=267" class="doc-link">#267 AGENTS</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Framework design. Sub-projects #268–270 exist. <strong>Zero todos.</strong> Cannot start.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AIAgentOrchestrationPlan') %]" class="doc-link">AIAgentOrchestrationPlan</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">#267</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Email + Secretary + notification regression. SECRETARY-AGENT child never created. Draft.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AI_Chat_System_Master_Audit') %]" class="doc-link">AI_Chat_System_Master_Audit</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">none</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Jan 2026 index. Stale vs live Router/ModelCatalog. Keep as archive index, not the plan.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AIChatSystemUserGuide') %]" class="doc-link">AIChatSystemUserGuide</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">none</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">How chat picks models today. Still useful; must track AIMPS after W1.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/E1_Grok_AI_Integration_Plan') %]" class="doc-link">E1_Grok_AI_Integration_Plan</a></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">historical</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Grok already in the provider layer. Do not reopen as a track.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">aisystem worktree <code>.hermes.md</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">this wave</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Was missing (worktree is its own git root). Written 2026-08-19.</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <h3 class="doc-h3">2.2 Project tree that matters</h3>
            <ul class="doc-body">
                <li><a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=63" class="doc-link">#63 AiIntegration</a> → <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=114" class="doc-link">#114 AIC-ENH</a> → AIMPS #252 / GITWT #238 / this coordinator #280</li>
                <li>Ollama children #105–132 still hold leftover install / fine-tune / chain_query todos</li>
                <li>AIC-DEV #115 still holds 2010-era phase leftovers (AIC-007..011)</li>
                <li>V2MIG #259 and AGENTS #267 are orphaned at the top level (fine — do not reparent)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="doc-warning">The Jan 2026 Master Audit and the live AIMPS/AGENTS plans describe different systems. Trust the live projects + this wave table, not the audit’s phase list.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="order" class="doc-h2">3. Wave order (do not skip ahead)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Each wave is a <strong>sub-project</strong>. Coordinator todos below point at owning-plan record_ids. Work those ids; do not clone the work here.</p>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">Wave</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Why this next</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Gate</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><strong>W0</strong> Hermes + context</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Agents without settings and a worktree <code>.hermes.md</code> ignore Comserv rules (this session started that way).</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>.hermes.md</code> exists; aliases <code>code</code>/<code>cheap</code>/<code>local</code>/<code>delegate</code> resolve; default coding model unchanged.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td"><strong>W1</strong> Right model on the right page</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Users still see an unfocused catalog. AIMPS P3/P2/P4 are the in-app equivalent of Hermes aliases.</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">#2026–2029, #2036, then #2024/#2025, then #2030 done on their AIMPS projects.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td"><strong>W2</strong> Agent runtime ready</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">AGENTS has projects and no todos. Notifications are email-only. Fine-tune leftovers compete with Router work.</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">#268–270 have real todos; notification regression has a todo; stale AIC/OFT parked at P9.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td"><strong>W3</strong> Operational agents</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Email agent then Secretary. In-app HelpDesk/Beekeeping/Ency stay blocked until their domain todos exist.</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Mail feeds DailyPlan/error-audit; Secretary can call via VoIP page. Not started before W2 gate.</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="hermes" class="doc-h2">4. Hermes focus settings (W0 — applied 2026-08-19)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Settings live in <code>~/.hermes/config.yaml</code> via <code>hermes config set</code> (never hand-edit). Secrets stay in <code>~/.hermes/.env</code>.</p>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">Role</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Alias</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Resolved</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">When</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">Coding (this agent)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>code</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>xai-oauth/grok-4.6</code> (also the session default)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Comserv edits, plans, audits</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">Cheap / local / delegate</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>cheap</code> <code>local</code> <code>delegate</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Ollama <code>qwen2.5-coder:14b</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Subagents, triage, summaries. <code>delegation.model</code> already this.</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p class="doc-body">Also on this machine (not aliased): <code>qwen2.5:72b</code>, <code>gemma4-64k</code>, <code>phi4:14b</code>. Use 72b only when a local deep-read beats a paid call. In-session: <code>/model code</code> or <code>/model cheap</code>.</p>
            <p class="doc-body">Remaining worktree <code>.hermes.md</code> files are owned by <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2142" class="doc-link">todo #2142</a> on GITWT-NEW — raised, not absorbed.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="providers" class="doc-h2">4b. In-app providers (current)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">The /ai and /ai2 model dropdown (and the floating Chat with AI widget) has <strong>four groups</strong>. SuperGrok is not a nickname for xAI.</p>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">Group</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Wire prefix</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Who sees it</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Credential (any container)</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">Ollama (Local)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>ollama|…</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">All roles (local models)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Live Ollama on the host</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">SuperGrok (prepaid)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>supergrok|grok-4.6</code> first</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">admin / developer / editor only</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>/run/secrets/supergrok_oauth</code>, mounted <code>/home/comserv/.comserv/secrets/supergrok_oauth</code>, env <code>SUPERGROK_OAUTH_TOKEN</code>, or Ency <code>UserApiKeys</code> service <code>supergrok</code>. Sync from Hermes: <code>perl script/sync_supergrok_token.pl</code>. Host <code>~/.hermes/auth.json</code> is last-resort workstation-only.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">xAI (Grok)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>grok|…</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">admin / developer / editor only</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Pay-per-token <code>GROK_API_KEY</code> / <code>/run/secrets/grok_api_key</code> / DB service <code>grok</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">OpenRouter</td>
                    <td class="doc-td"><code>openrouter|…</code></td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Role-filtered (guests: :free only)</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">OpenRouter key (k8s / env / DB)</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p class="doc-warning">The same slug <code>grok-4.6</code> can appear under SuperGrok and under xAI. Pick the SuperGrok (prepaid) group to spend the subscription. After send, the status line must stay SuperGrok — if it flips to Grok (xAI) that was a label bug (fixed: Router keeps prefix <code>supergrok</code>; Chat.pm dispatches it to the Grok client; JS does not relabel).</p>
            <p class="doc-body">W1.0 (<a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2202" class="doc-link">#2202</a>) delivered this source. Remaining W1 is AIMPS shortlists/sort, not another provider.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="park" class="doc-h2">5. Parked until W1 gate (do not cancel)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">These stay in the DB at priority 9 so they stop winning the daily queue:</p>
            <ul class="doc-body">
                <li>AIC leftover phases #242–246 (AIC-007..011) — predates Router/AIMPS</li>
                <li>Ollama fine-tune / Modelfile OFT #266–278</li>
                <li>chain_query multi-model #262–265 — after shortlists exist</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="doc-body">Keep live: #562 (AI create todos), #778 (document adding a project), GITWT Hermes context #2142–2146, AIMPS #2024–2036.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

